          <choice_text>임금은 시장임금을 적용한다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>세금은 비용에서 제외한다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>세금은 비용에 포함하므로 옳지 않아 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>정부보조금은 비용에서 제외한다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>지불이자는 비용에 포함한다.</choice_text>
          <commentary>옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
      <exam_history repeat_count="1">단독 출제 문항</exam_history>
